        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.win32.menuSelect": {
    "notes": "win32 侧独有。**靶子还没有菜单栏**，所以成功路径无从谈起：用真实会话配一条菜单路径，pywinauto 的 menu_select 会抛，执行器包成 EXECUTOR_FAILED。这条期望是**推断**（依据：实现里 _menu_select 直接转给 pywinauto，没有自己的菜单不存在分支），首次启用时按实际结果校正——正路要真靶子先有菜单栏（登记在任务单 §3）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "no-menu-bar-shows-up-as-an-executor-failure",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "menuPath": [
            "File"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "EXECUTOR_FAILED"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "multi-level-path-uses-the-same-arrow-join",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}",
          "menuPath": [
            "File",
            "Exit"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "EXECUTOR_FAILED"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session",
          "menuPath": [
            "File"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
